(4946397, 719842, 37252, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, though the image is not convincing enough. The guy does not seem to be trying too hard to move the rocks, as the legs seem too relaxed to truly be putting forth effort. The rocks are interesting - perhaps bring out a bit more of their textures.</td>', 'The idea is good, though the image is not convincing enough. The guy does not seem to be trying too hard to move the rocks, as the legs seem too relaxed to truly be putting forth effort. The rocks are interesting - perhaps bring out a bit more of their textures.', '2008-09-10 04:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
