(4946824, 720255, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great capture and depiction of the challenge.  I would have preferred that the guy was not cropped partly out of the photo,  and also the edge of the clock, but that is just me being really picky.  Top Image!!</td>', 'Great capture and depiction of the challenge.  I would have preferred that the guy was not cropped partly out of the photo,  and also the edge of the clock, but that is just me being really picky.  Top Image!!', '2008-09-10 09:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4946827, 719952, 96881, '<td valign="top">There looks to be a lot of noise in this photo on  my screen.  I loose the guys head in the background, and the photo does not look sharp either.</td>', 'There looks to be a lot of noise in this photo on  my screen.  I loose the guys head in the background, and the photo does not look sharp either.', '2008-09-10 09:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4946851, 717912, 26464, '<td valign="top">ohhhhh... the poor paint.</td>', 'ohhhhh... the poor paint.', '2008-09-10 09:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4946853, 718882, 47316, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool shot. I suspect you are going to be getting a lot of DNMCs though since both objects are very movable. I get that it is a struggle but I don''t think it really fits. I think as far as composition you could have moved the cars towards the bottom of the frame, that much foreground is unnecessary and I find myself more interested in the crowd than the cars themselves but some of the heads are cut off.</td>', 'This is a pretty cool shot. I suspect you are going to be getting a lot of DNMCs though since both objects are very movable. I get that it is a struggle but I don''t think it really fits. I think as far as composition you could have moved the cars towards the bottom of the frame, that much foreground is unnecessary and I find myself more interested in the crowd than the cars themselves but some of the heads are cut off.', '2008-09-10 09:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4946856, 718700, 26464, '<td valign="top">a winner</td>', 'a winner', '2008-09-10 09:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4946857, 720255, 47316, '<td valign="top">Yes! this is awesome. I wasn''t crazy about the composition at first but the more I look at it the more it grows on me.</td>', 'Yes! this is awesome. I wasn''t crazy about the composition at first but the more I look at it the more it grows on me.', '2008-09-10 09:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4946860, 718700, 47316, '<td valign="top">wow... this has a really strange feel to it. She''s like an angel and her expression seems real to me. I like it a lot though I think the editing could be reworked some. I think the composition is kind of like a snapshot and the figure could have been made a little darker to hide some of the grain and provide more contrast (but with everyone having different monitors, maybe it looked like that to you, it''s happened to me before!)</td>', 'wow... this has a really strange feel to it. She''s like an angel and her expression seems real to me. I like it a lot though I think the editing could be reworked some. I think the composition is kind of like a snapshot and the figure could have been made a little darker to hide some of the grain and provide more contrast (but with everyone having different monitors, maybe it looked like that to you, it''s happened to me before!)', '2008-09-10 09:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4946861, 720189, 96574, '<td valign="top">doesnt look like rocky road ice cream in that cone...<br/>funny picture anyway</td>', 'doesnt look like rocky road ice cream in that cone...funny picture anyway', '2008-09-10 09:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
