(4947576, 719650, 95884, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting that you used to capture this image.  It acts to fade out the background.</td>', 'I love the lighting that you used to capture this image.  It acts to fade out the background.', '2008-09-10 13:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
