(4947584, 719366, 95884, '<td valign="top">This is exactly the type of shot I expect from a challenge like this, although another angle might prove beneficial to eliminate a busy background.  Although I realize that is sometime nearly impossible for a shot like this.  Great shot</td>', 'This is exactly the type of shot I expect from a challenge like this, although another angle might prove beneficial to eliminate a busy background.  Although I realize that is sometime nearly impossible for a shot like this.  Great shot', '2008-09-10 13:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
