(4947589, 720208, 95361, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Really creative.  I would have cropped it a little tighter though to show the guy struggling to get the boat to move.</td>', 'Great idea.  Really creative.  I would have cropped it a little tighter though to show the guy struggling to get the boat to move.', '2008-09-10 13:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
