(4947603, 719952, 38478, '<td valign="top">Its too dark. Work with the levels to boost the range and I think it would work much better.</td>', 'Its too dark. Work with the levels to boost the range and I think it would work much better.', '2008-09-10 13:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947605, 720161, 95361, '<td valign="top">Great pic.  I like the crop a lot.</td>', 'Great pic.  I like the crop a lot.', '2008-09-10 13:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947608, 720129, 95884, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. Exactly what I expect from this challenge.  Great composition for this shot too.  You did a great job eliminating distracting backgrounds common for this type of shot.</td>', 'This is a great photo. Exactly what I expect from this challenge.  Great composition for this shot too.  You did a great job eliminating distracting backgrounds common for this type of shot.', '2008-09-10 13:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947611, 720188, 9073, '<td valign="top">When I view this image I think about the why of pushing stones that are impossible to move. The futility of life rears its ugly head and I''m depressed. On the other hand, humans love challenges even those they are doomed to fail. Is this image pessimistic or optimistic?</td>', 'When I view this image I think about the why of pushing stones that are impossible to move. The futility of life rears its ugly head and I''m depressed. On the other hand, humans love challenges even those they are doomed to fail. Is this image pessimistic or optimistic?', '2008-09-10 13:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947613, 720145, 95884, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting.  Most times the harsh light does not work but this seems to work well</td>', 'I love the lighting.  Most times the harsh light does not work but this seems to work well', '2008-09-10 13:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947616, 719047, 95361, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it was unoriginal but then I noticed that the tree looks like it''s bending...I really like that you took such an obvious idea and made it far more original than most.  Good job!</td>', 'At first I thought it was unoriginal but then I noticed that the tree looks like it''s bending...I really like that you took such an obvious idea and made it far more original than most.  Good job!', '2008-09-10 13:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947618, 719062, 38478, '<td valign="top">try cropping out the blown out foreground</td>', 'try cropping out the blown out foreground', '2008-09-10 13:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947620, 720141, 9073, '<td valign="top">This can be read 2 ways: he''s so gifted that he can open a door the other way, or that he''s stupid. Also, he''s pushing OUT of the school into the outdoors, or does this mean that the school is actually the real world? Either way, he doesn''t look that happy.</td>', 'This can be read 2 ways: he''s so gifted that he can open a door the other way, or that he''s stupid. Also, he''s pushing OUT of the school into the outdoors, or does this mean that the school is actually the real world? Either way, he doesn''t look that happy.', '2008-09-10 13:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947622, 718927, 95361, '<td valign="top">As for the idea, I''d give the picture a perfect 10.  It really is a great concept.  The execution seems a little off to me.  I like that you went for the washed out/grainy look...but there seems to be some spots in the picture that are too hot.  For example some of the skin tones are too overexposed.</td>', 'As for the idea, I''d give the picture a perfect 10.  It really is a great concept.  The execution seems a little off to me.  I like that you went for the washed out/grainy look...but there seems to be some spots in the picture that are too hot.  For example some of the skin tones are too overexposed.', '2008-09-10 13:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947627, 720189, 88523, '<td valign="top">o</td>', 'o', '2008-09-10 13:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947633, 719062, 95361, '<td valign="top">If you were shooting a handstand, I would have liked to see the entire handstand...I think this is way too close of a crop to get perspective on what''s happening.  Also, I think the lighting is weird.</td>', 'If you were shooting a handstand, I would have liked to see the entire handstand...I think this is way too close of a crop to get perspective on what''s happening.  Also, I think the lighting is weird.', '2008-09-10 13:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947634, 718556, 95884, '<td valign="top">This is a great B&amp;W photo.  I love the lighting on the photo.  I am just a bit unsure as to how it pertains to this particular challenge.</td>', 'This is a great B&W photo.  I love the lighting on the photo.  I am just a bit unsure as to how it pertains to this particular challenge.', '2008-09-10 13:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947637, 718436, 38478, '<td valign="top">dark, muddy, flat color -- work with levels and saturation a bit.</td>', 'dark, muddy, flat color -- work with levels and saturation a bit.', '2008-09-10 13:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947640, 720029, 95884, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.  Over-exposing this background whether intentionally or necessary created a great effect of eliminating any distractions.  Great photo</td>', 'This is excellent.  Over-exposing this background whether intentionally or necessary created a great effect of eliminating any distractions.  Great photo', '2008-09-10 13:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
