(4947774, 720123, 60658, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  Hope you don''t get too many DNMCs for your creativity.  There seems to be some nice colors on the clothing that are lost in the darkness.  While this may have been a creative choice, I think it would have added to the image had they been brighter.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  Hope you don''t get too many DNMCs for your creativity.  There seems to be some nice colors on the clothing that are lost in the darkness.  While this may have been a creative choice, I think it would have added to the image had they been brighter.', '2008-09-10 14:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
