(4947779, 718456, 47316, '<td valign="top">Hmm. Uh oh! The tides aren''t a person. You get a negative 5! Woops. Sorry. Left over angst from the forum discussion. ;) No this is actually a nice shot and I think it fits the theme. Honestly I think they should have just made the challenge "Immovable" and the description "N/A" and we''d be a lot better off. Now as far as the image itself. The colors are great! But there seems to be something off. I think the boat really isn''t the subject as it should be and there is a lot of dark area that really doesn''t do the image well on the right side. I see you probably had to keep most of it in to get that beautiful sky in though. A different angle when the shot was taken would have done you well, but I think the angle that would have been best would probably have put you in the water. Possibly a solution would be a tighter crop with the boat in the bottom left 3rd and the brightest point in the sky at the top right 3rd kind of balancing each other out... <br/> <br/>Sorry for the brick of text. :)</td>', 'Hmm. Uh oh! The tides aren''t a person. You get a negative 5! Woops. Sorry. Left over angst from the forum discussion. ;) No this is actually a nice shot and I think it fits the theme. Honestly I think they should have just made the challenge "Immovable" and the description "N/A" and we''d be a lot better off. Now as far as the image itself. The colors are great! But there seems to be something off. I think the boat really isn''t the subject as it should be and there is a lot of dark area that really doesn''t do the image well on the right side. I see you probably had to keep most of it in to get that beautiful sky in though. A different angle when the shot was taken would have done you well, but I think the angle that would have been best would probably have put you in the water. Possibly a solution would be a tighter crop with the boat in the bottom left 3rd and the brightest point in the sky at the top right 3rd kind of balancing each other out...  Sorry for the brick of text. :)', '2008-09-10 14:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4947781, 719828, 60658, '<td valign="top">Haha.  Way to be creative!  Too bad this wasn''t a advanced editing so that grimace could be brought out.</td>', 'Haha.  Way to be creative!  Too bad this wasn''t a advanced editing so that grimace could be brought out.', '2008-09-10 14:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
