(4947786, 719650, 47316, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get what is supposed to be going on here? I mean I do but I don''t think you quite pulled it off. It seems like you tried to make a story line in the photo but fell short. The lighting is nice, kind of flat though. And the colors and set are all ok but really this shot shows motion to me... not "immovable".</td>', 'I don''t really get what is supposed to be going on here? I mean I do but I don''t think you quite pulled it off. It seems like you tried to make a story line in the photo but fell short. The lighting is nice, kind of flat though. And the colors and set are all ok but really this shot shows motion to me... not "immovable".', '2008-09-10 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
