(4948432, 720053, 60658, '<td valign="top">"Take a photo of someone trying to move an immovable <b>object</b>." Looked at this image a few times before voting.  Don''t see how it meets challenge or what your thoughts could have been regarding the object.  <br/> <br/>The treatment is interesting. Not a fan of the resulting noise from the oversharpening.</td>', '"Take a photo of someone trying to move an immovable object." Looked at this image a few times before voting.  Don''t see how it meets challenge or what your thoughts could have been regarding the object.   The treatment is interesting. Not a fan of the resulting noise from the oversharpening.', '2008-09-10 19:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948477, 718730, 60658, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective to achieve this result.  A little noisy and soft.  I would also try to match the exposure on the hand to make them appear closer.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective to achieve this result.  A little noisy and soft.  I would also try to match the exposure on the hand to make them appear closer.', '2008-09-10 20:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948481, 719998, 60658, '<td valign="top">Not sure if by lift you are referring to these guys being on an elevator, or crane or something because the crop is too tight to tell that story.  Light from the left side is a bit harsh on the face and washes out the colors.</td>', 'Not sure if by lift you are referring to these guys being on an elevator, or crane or something because the crop is too tight to tell that story.  Light from the left side is a bit harsh on the face and washes out the colors.', '2008-09-10 20:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948492, 718291, 60658, '<td valign="top">"Take a photo of <b>someone</b> trying to move an immovable object." As I see no one real or metaphorical, I have to say DNMC.  Sky is nicely exposed but photo lacks interest in the midtones.</td>', '"Take a photo of someone trying to move an immovable object." As I see no one real or metaphorical, I have to say DNMC.  Sky is nicely exposed but photo lacks interest in the midtones.', '2008-09-10 20:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948528, 719142, 60658, '<td valign="top">The fish look dead already, how could they move the grip!  Maybe a longer shutter speed could have captured some movement.  Although a noob here, my advice is to take an image that meets the challenge without the help of a title.  Shallow DOF is nice, though image is a little dark.</td>', 'The fish look dead already, how could they move the grip!  Maybe a longer shutter speed could have captured some movement.  Although a noob here, my advice is to take an image that meets the challenge without the help of a title.  Shallow DOF is nice, though image is a little dark.', '2008-09-10 20:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4948532, 719636, 60658, '<td valign="top">Gratuitous cleavage, while appealing has no power over me (repeating over and over).  Lighting is such that it is difficult to tell exactly what is going on here.</td>', 'Gratuitous cleavage, while appealing has no power over me (repeating over and over).  Lighting is such that it is difficult to tell exactly what is going on here.', '2008-09-10 20:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
