(4949683, 720161, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Good pose and expression on the model''s face.</td>', 'Nice idea. Good pose and expression on the model''s face.', '2008-09-11 06:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949685, 720123, 46314, '<td valign="top">Original idea. Nicely shot.</td>', 'Original idea. Nicely shot.', '2008-09-11 06:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949687, 720293, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is immovable. It''s a very nice shot though, just not sure it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure how this is immovable. It''s a very nice shot though, just not sure it meets the challenge.', '2008-09-11 06:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949688, 718436, 46314, '<td valign="top">Immovable?</td>', 'Immovable?', '2008-09-11 06:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949691, 720260, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea.</td>', 'Very clever idea.', '2008-09-11 06:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949694, 720064, 46314, '<td valign="top">That happens in South Africa all the time. We call it cable theft. Turns out it''s not so immovable after all... I like the way you shot the silhouettes.</td>', 'That happens in South Africa all the time. We call it cable theft. Turns out it''s not so immovable after all... I like the way you shot the silhouettes.', '2008-09-11 06:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949695, 718890, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. Emphasises the contrast in size between the boy and the rock. Communicates the idea well.</td>', 'Nice angle. Emphasises the contrast in size between the boy and the rock. Communicates the idea well.', '2008-09-11 06:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949704, 720029, 5364, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, but in my opinion you would have improved it by having your models not looking at the camera.</td>', 'A nice idea, but in my opinion you would have improved it by having your models not looking at the camera.', '2008-09-11 06:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949712, 719799, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice communication of the idea in this photo. But I can tell that wreck''s going nowhere :-)</td>', 'Nice communication of the idea in this photo. But I can tell that wreck''s going nowhere :-)', '2008-09-11 06:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949714, 718556, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lol. Very funny idea. Certainly original.</td>', 'Lol. Very funny idea. Certainly original.', '2008-09-11 06:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949716, 718456, 46314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.', '2008-09-11 06:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949717, 720148, 46314, '<td valign="top">Humourous attempt.</td>', 'Humourous attempt.', '2008-09-11 06:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949718, 720145, 46314, '<td valign="top">The model''s pose conveys the sense of futility at trying to move the object well.</td>', 'The model''s pose conveys the sense of futility at trying to move the object well.', '2008-09-11 06:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949720, 719952, 46314, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the dark and unflattering lighting. And the attempt to portray trying to move something immovable seems unconvincing to me.</td>', 'I don''t like the dark and unflattering lighting. And the attempt to portray trying to move something immovable seems unconvincing to me.', '2008-09-11 06:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949722, 720053, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I fully understand this shot. Is it two hands trying to touch through the immovable barrier? <br/>The little things that bother me in the pic is the desaturation - it doesn''t seem consistent - there are little patches of colour on the arm that don''t match. And I don''t really like the way the fingertips have been cropped off, it loses the shape of the praying hands.<br/>I think with a little more work it could be a powerful image though.</td>', 'I''m not sure I fully understand this shot. Is it two hands trying to touch through the immovable barrier? The little things that bother me in the pic is the desaturation - it doesn''t seem consistent - there are little patches of colour on the arm that don''t match. And I don''t really like the way the fingertips have been cropped off, it loses the shape of the praying hands.I think with a little more work it could be a powerful image though.', '2008-09-11 06:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949723, 718730, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clever angle. Not altogether convincing though - could''ve executed it a little better.</td>', 'Clever angle. Not altogether convincing though - could''ve executed it a little better.', '2008-09-11 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949724, 720045, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very funny idea. Nice shot.</td>', 'Very funny idea. Nice shot.', '2008-09-11 06:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949726, 720208, 46314, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea. There are many shots in this challenge of people trying to push stranded vehicles/crafts, but the use of the oar to paddle in your shot is inspired. Makes what could be a mundane image somewhat surreal and very humourous. Nice work.</td>', 'A very clever idea. There are many shots in this challenge of people trying to push stranded vehicles/crafts, but the use of the oar to paddle in your shot is inspired. Makes what could be a mundane image somewhat surreal and very humourous. Nice work.', '2008-09-11 06:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949748, 720255, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love this interpretation, absolutely fantastic. Love that clear, smooth negative space too.</td>', 'I love this interpretation, absolutely fantastic. Love that clear, smooth negative space too.', '2008-09-11 07:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949750, 719145, 94265, '<td valign="top">Now this is awesome, great colours and a fantastic idea!</td>', 'Now this is awesome, great colours and a fantastic idea!', '2008-09-11 07:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949752, 719845, 94265, '<td valign="top">What a wicked idea, the sky looks lovely.</td>', 'What a wicked idea, the sky looks lovely.', '2008-09-11 07:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949753, 720129, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very literal entry but nothing wrong with that at all :) This is really good, very cool sculpture. His face is red, he really looks like he''s trying to move that thing!</td>', 'Very literal entry but nothing wrong with that at all :) This is really good, very cool sculpture. His face is red, he really looks like he''s trying to move that thing!', '2008-09-11 07:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949754, 718556, 94265, '<td valign="top">Hahaha this gets an extra point for making me grin.</td>', 'Hahaha this gets an extra point for making me grin.', '2008-09-11 07:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949755, 718456, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, just gorgeous.</td>', 'Beautiful sky, just gorgeous.', '2008-09-11 07:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949756, 720120, 94265, '<td valign="top">Hehe his expression is great and the b&amp;w looks good too.</td>', 'Hehe his expression is great and the b&w looks good too.', '2008-09-11 07:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949758, 720293, 94265, '<td valign="top">It certainly is hard to get a butterfly onto your hand, I''ll give you that! Nice colour on it too and good DOF.</td>', 'It certainly is hard to get a butterfly onto your hand, I''ll give you that! Nice colour on it too and good DOF.', '2008-09-11 07:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949759, 720208, 94265, '<td valign="top">Love the idea and love the title to boot.</td>', 'Love the idea and love the title to boot.', '2008-09-11 07:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949760, 719636, 94265, '<td valign="top">What an awesome costume!</td>', 'What an awesome costume!', '2008-09-11 07:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949761, 720029, 94265, '<td valign="top">The sky is overexposed back there but this idea is awesome, made me smile.</td>', 'The sky is overexposed back there but this idea is awesome, made me smile.', '2008-09-11 07:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949762, 719922, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and colours in this shot.</td>', 'Lovely tones and colours in this shot.', '2008-09-11 07:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949763, 720161, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great light, his expression is funny as Hell. Good job.</td>', 'Great light, his expression is funny as Hell. Good job.', '2008-09-11 07:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949764, 719434, 94265, '<td valign="top">Hehe this is cute, nice contrast and shadows. Would''ve been nice in colour also.</td>', 'Hehe this is cute, nice contrast and shadows. Would''ve been nice in colour also.', '2008-09-11 07:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949765, 720123, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love the set-up of this, though the significance of the shell instead of a crystal is lost on me, I''ll admit.</td>', 'I love the set-up of this, though the significance of the shell instead of a crystal is lost on me, I''ll admit.', '2008-09-11 07:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949766, 719488, 94265, '<td valign="top">His face looks a bit blown-out but it''s a great shot otherwise.</td>', 'His face looks a bit blown-out but it''s a great shot otherwise.', '2008-09-11 07:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949767, 719828, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like this interpretation.</td>', 'I like this interpretation.', '2008-09-11 07:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949768, 719644, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like how the focus is mainly on those two grappling kids, the DOF stops there being too much else to concentrate on.</td>', 'I like how the focus is mainly on those two grappling kids, the DOF stops there being too much else to concentrate on.', '2008-09-11 07:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949769, 720188, 94265, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a wee bit dull on her but it serves to enhance the size of the boulder by drawing your eyes up to the light on it, in my view.</td>', 'The lighting is a wee bit dull on her but it serves to enhance the size of the boulder by drawing your eyes up to the light on it, in my view.', '2008-09-11 07:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949770, 719139, 94265, '<td valign="top">Bit of motion blur there, it''d help if Woody was more in focus. Still a cute shot, makes me wish I''d submitted by own Woody idea! The b&amp;w is nice.</td>', 'Bit of motion blur there, it''d help if Woody was more in focus. Still a cute shot, makes me wish I''d submitted by own Woody idea! The b&w is nice.', '2008-09-11 07:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949771, 719047, 94265, '<td valign="top">Hehe this looks so cool with the tilted tree.</td>', 'Hehe this looks so cool with the tilted tree.', '2008-09-11 07:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949772, 719544, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice professional-looking model shot.</td>', 'Nice professional-looking model shot.', '2008-09-11 07:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949773, 717912, 94265, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have imagined a sex-appeal picture to be entered in this challenge but there you go! It''s a great shot, really good focus.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have imagined a sex-appeal picture to be entered in this challenge but there you go! It''s a great shot, really good focus.', '2008-09-11 07:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949774, 720263, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge.', '2008-09-11 07:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949775, 720064, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like that soft yellow hue melting into the blue, I''d have liked a wee bit more light on the person though.</td>', 'I like that soft yellow hue melting into the blue, I''d have liked a wee bit more light on the person though.', '2008-09-11 07:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949776, 718890, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good shot, shame about the graffiti.</td>', 'Good shot, shame about the graffiti.', '2008-09-11 07:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949777, 718491, 94265, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit more possessive than loving to me, holding the child''s hand by the wrist that way. Still, the light and tone look great.</td>', 'This looks a bit more possessive than loving to me, holding the child''s hand by the wrist that way. Still, the light and tone look great.', '2008-09-11 07:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949778, 719650, 94265, '<td valign="top">The shot looks really good though I''m not entirely sure what''s happening in it.</td>', 'The shot looks really good though I''m not entirely sure what''s happening in it.', '2008-09-11 07:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949779, 719954, 94265, '<td valign="top">That is one scary ass bug! What on earth is it....? He blends in a bit too well with the ground but it''s a good capture, I like the idea.</td>', 'That is one scary ass bug! What on earth is it....? He blends in a bit too well with the ground but it''s a good capture, I like the idea.', '2008-09-11 07:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949780, 719998, 94265, '<td valign="top">The light is a wee bit harsh on the statue''s face.</td>', 'The light is a wee bit harsh on the statue''s face.', '2008-09-11 07:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949781, 720089, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand the title, is that a Pringles tube top in his hand? It''s a good clear shot though, great focus on his face.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand the title, is that a Pringles tube top in his hand? It''s a good clear shot though, great focus on his face.', '2008-09-11 07:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949782, 719948, 94265, '<td valign="top">This made me chuckle. I like the crop, helps to give the illusion of great immensity to the mini bridge, or whatever it is.</td>', 'This made me chuckle. I like the crop, helps to give the illusion of great immensity to the mini bridge, or whatever it is.', '2008-09-11 07:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949783, 720125, 94265, '<td valign="top">The light is a wee bit dark, looks like early morning or late evening. Good idea though, it''s cool you had this resource nearby.</td>', 'The light is a wee bit dark, looks like early morning or late evening. Good idea though, it''s cool you had this resource nearby.', '2008-09-11 07:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949784, 719366, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d like this more if he wasn''t looking at the camera, nice bold colours though.</td>', 'I''d like this more if he wasn''t looking at the camera, nice bold colours though.', '2008-09-11 07:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949785, 718882, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped the foreground up a tad but I really like this.</td>', 'I''d have cropped the foreground up a tad but I really like this.', '2008-09-11 07:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949786, 719145, 64568, '<td valign="top">Gotta be the blue!! ;) Really great shot, clear and sharp, great colours, wonderful composition and perfectly executed idea, well done.</td>', 'Gotta be the blue!! ;) Really great shot, clear and sharp, great colours, wonderful composition and perfectly executed idea, well done.', '2008-09-11 07:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949787, 720069, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this meets the criteria but it''s a very moving shot.</td>', 'I don''t think this meets the criteria but it''s a very moving shot.', '2008-09-11 07:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949789, 720189, 94265, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea, it just needs to be a bit more in focus.</td>', 'I really like this idea, it just needs to be a bit more in focus.', '2008-09-11 07:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949790, 720141, 94265, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been really funny and effective if his expression showed some effort, he looks kinda sleepy.</td>', 'This would''ve been really funny and effective if his expression showed some effort, he looks kinda sleepy.', '2008-09-11 07:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949791, 720260, 94265, '<td valign="top">The focus could stand to be a little sharper.</td>', 'The focus could stand to be a little sharper.', '2008-09-11 07:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949792, 719142, 94265, '<td valign="top">Fish creep me out so much.....good focus.</td>', 'Fish creep me out so much.....good focus.', '2008-09-11 07:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949793, 719952, 94265, '<td valign="top">Looks like a shot from a drunken night with the boys, haha. Very funny expression. Bit too dark.</td>', 'Looks like a shot from a drunken night with the boys, haha. Very funny expression. Bit too dark.', '2008-09-11 07:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4949794, 718436, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d kinda like this better without the roll-up in his hand, makes it seem a bit random and unprepared for. It''s a smart idea though, alternative youth of today against the authority of politics and all that jazz.</td>', 'I''d kinda like this better without the roll-up in his hand, makes it seem a bit random and unprepared for. It''s a smart idea though, alternative youth of today against the authority of politics and all that jazz.', '2008-09-11 07:48:42.000000', NULL, 1);
