(4949868, 719145, 77192, '<td valign="top">very clever using the fish eye to achieve the effect you have. But the blue and green are way too bright for me.</td>', 'very clever using the fish eye to achieve the effect you have. But the blue and green are way too bright for me.', '2008-09-11 08:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
