(4950621, 720029, 16062, '<td valign="top">If you had used more of the 150kb maximum file size, the compression artifact would probably not have been so noticeable.  I''d like to have seen a little more detail in the shadows, a little fill light would have gone a long ways here.  I like the way you placed your subjects in the lower part of the frame, it emphasizes the size of the rock. Might have been better not to cut their feet off though.</td>', 'If you had used more of the 150kb maximum file size, the compression artifact would probably not have been so noticeable.  I''d like to have seen a little more detail in the shadows, a little fill light would have gone a long ways here.  I like the way you placed your subjects in the lower part of the frame, it emphasizes the size of the rock. Might have been better not to cut their feet off though.', '2008-09-11 16:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4950622, 720208, 47791, '<td valign="top">Very good idea. Maybe a bit more thought could have been put into composition as the brish sky distarcts from the actual subject of this image.</td>', 'Very good idea. Maybe a bit more thought could have been put into composition as the brish sky distarcts from the actual subject of this image.', '2008-09-11 16:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
