(4950745, 720069, 47791, '<td valign="top">I like how your trying to tell a story and that you aren''t scared to put in something as provocative as this. <br/>Composition is good and I like how you got the hill and subject and sky in the image. <br/>The image is let down though by the tone used and the burnt out sky.  Its very hard to see straight off that the person is in a graveyard. <br/>Please keep entering challenges as you obviously like to try something different which will help you stand out.</td>', 'I like how your trying to tell a story and that you aren''t scared to put in something as provocative as this. Composition is good and I like how you got the hill and subject and sky in the image. The image is let down though by the tone used and the burnt out sky.  Its very hard to see straight off that the person is in a graveyard. Please keep entering challenges as you obviously like to try something different which will help you stand out.', '2008-09-11 18:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
