(4952307, 720045, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>The idea here is great but the setup is lacking. I feel that the crop is a bit too tight. The apparent use of the on-camera flash is always distracting. The colors feel a bit flat, and the photo is too smooth, lacking the necessary sharpness.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 The idea here is great but the setup is lacking. I feel that the crop is a bit too tight. The apparent use of the on-camera flash is always distracting. The colors feel a bit flat, and the photo is too smooth, lacking the necessary sharpness.', '2008-09-12 15:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952311, 720188, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>Where is the creativity? The framing was done well. The exposure is a bit off. The shadows in the background are extremely dark. There are several hot spots on the rock that need to be brought back. The position of the model could be modified to show an expression of strain on the face.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 Where is the creativity? The framing was done well. The exposure is a bit off. The shadows in the background are extremely dark. There are several hot spots on the rock that need to be brought back. The position of the model could be modified to show an expression of strain on the face.', '2008-09-12 15:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952315, 719145, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Very creative idea. I like the fisheye look on this. It would have been nice to have more time to set up with a rope, stiffened with a wire perhaps, and held in the sky, giving the appearance of being attached to the building. The colors are way oversaturated, and most of the clouds have completely lost all detail in the highlights.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Very creative idea. I like the fisheye look on this. It would have been nice to have more time to set up with a rope, stiffened with a wire perhaps, and held in the sky, giving the appearance of being attached to the building. The colors are way oversaturated, and most of the clouds have completely lost all detail in the highlights.', '2008-09-12 15:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952322, 719366, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>There seem to be a lot of simple shots identical to this one. I am happy to see the model''s face in this shot, looking like he is straining to move the train. This challenge would have been much cooler in the advanced editing, or the expert editing even. Then you could have really made this stand out, using some high contrast, grunge editing, and even made the foot appear to be sinking in the ground. Oh well. Still a decent shot.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 There seem to be a lot of simple shots identical to this one. I am happy to see the model''s face in this shot, looking like he is straining to move the train. This challenge would have been much cooler in the advanced editing, or the expert editing even. Then you could have really made this stand out, using some high contrast, grunge editing, and even made the foot appear to be sinking in the ground. Oh well. Still a decent shot.', '2008-09-12 15:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952324, 720208, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice shot. I had to laugh upon first viewing this photo. The idea is great. It would be nice to have included more of the surrounding area, and not have the boat in the center of the composition.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice shot. I had to laugh upon first viewing this photo. The idea is great. It would be nice to have included more of the surrounding area, and not have the boat in the center of the composition.', '2008-09-12 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952327, 719488, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Put a shoulder in to it! Where is the sweat and strain on the model''s face from trying to move something immovable? The editing on everything except the model''s face looks really good. The face looks pale and blotchy in comparison to the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Put a shoulder in to it! Where is the sweat and strain on the model''s face from trying to move something immovable? The editing on everything except the model''s face looks really good. The face looks pale and blotchy in comparison to the rest of the photo.', '2008-09-12 15:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952329, 720141, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 0/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>Oh, I love the Far Side comic strips, and this is one that I have always remembered. Great idea. The entire photo is a bit muddy and underexposed, lacking in contrast and punchy colors. The crop is way too tight, and the model appears to be resting against the door, and not trying to open it.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 0/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 Oh, I love the Far Side comic strips, and this is one that I have always remembered. Great idea. The entire photo is a bit muddy and underexposed, lacking in contrast and punchy colors. The crop is way too tight, and the model appears to be resting against the door, and not trying to open it.', '2008-09-12 15:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952335, 718556, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>There are way too many hot spots in the photograph. The crop is exceptionally tight. Excluding the challenges presented by shooting a moving/live subject, this photo should be much sharper than it is. Including more of the reflection in the foreground would have helped. And if the background had the "someone" in it, outside the DOF, this shot would have been improved.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 There are way too many hot spots in the photograph. The crop is exceptionally tight. Excluding the challenges presented by shooting a moving/live subject, this photo should be much sharper than it is. Including more of the reflection in the foreground would have helped. And if the background had the "someone" in it, outside the DOF, this shot would have been improved.', '2008-09-12 15:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952338, 719845, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Very nice idea. A fill flash for the hand would have been nice to see used in this photo. As for the complexities of exposure on this type of shot, you did really well.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Very nice idea. A fill flash for the hand would have been nice to see used in this photo. As for the complexities of exposure on this type of shot, you did really well.', '2008-09-12 15:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952341, 719952, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 0/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>This shot is the perfect example of why not to use an on-camera flash unit with automatic settings. You get a subject with the exposure falling off the edges (head and shoulders), no background, etc. The centered composition would also work better if the photo was taken straight on, instead of from the left side.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 0/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 This shot is the perfect example of why not to use an on-camera flash unit with automatic settings. You get a subject with the exposure falling off the edges (head and shoulders), no background, etc. The centered composition would also work better if the photo was taken straight on, instead of from the left side.', '2008-09-12 15:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952342, 720263, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2', '2008-09-12 15:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
