(4954457, 720145, 87898, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, I wish I could have seen the rest of her foot and from where she''s trying to pull/push the bar.</td>', 'I like the photo, I wish I could have seen the rest of her foot and from where she''s trying to pull/push the bar.', '2008-09-14 08:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
