(4955359, 720123, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesting Dipiction of the topic, and in my opinion meets the challenge, thiking outside the square.  I like the black background, but maygbe a little more contrast with the colours in the shawl.  Also, the light is uneven, with the right side (right arm/shoulder) disappearing into the darkness.</td>', 'Interesting Dipiction of the topic, and in my opinion meets the challenge, thiking outside the square.  I like the black background, but maygbe a little more contrast with the colours in the shawl.  Also, the light is uneven, with the right side (right arm/shoulder) disappearing into the darkness.', '2008-09-15 00:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955362, 719828, 96881, '<td valign="top">Good Challenge entry.  The contrasting colours work here very well.  Also the smaller kid against the bigger one.  Would have been brilliant if it was only the two kids in the photo, and not the teammates who are partially cropped out, but when taking action photos, you can''t do much about that.  Depth of field is great, subjects are sharp and the background blurred.</td>', 'Good Challenge entry.  The contrasting colours work here very well.  Also the smaller kid against the bigger one.  Would have been brilliant if it was only the two kids in the photo, and not the teammates who are partially cropped out, but when taking action photos, you can''t do much about that.  Depth of field is great, subjects are sharp and the background blurred.', '2008-09-15 00:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955365, 717912, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different, stark, and that works here.  Like the effect you have gone with.  Refelctions in the bumper are a shame (lower right) and the cropped grill/headlights distract.  Maybe a different crop would have worked but not sure.</td>', 'Different, stark, and that works here.  Like the effect you have gone with.  Refelctions in the bumper are a shame (lower right) and the cropped grill/headlights distract.  Maybe a different crop would have worked but not sure.', '2008-09-15 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
