(4955679, 718291, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Photo, but DNMC. Even though it would be very difficult to move, the challenge did ask for Someone trying to move an immovable object.<br/>Ignirng that, it seems to me that the photo is on an angle.  ie it tilts to the right.  it seems that the camera was not level when taken, and gives an effect of everything sliding to the right</td>', 'Nice Photo, but DNMC. Even though it would be very difficult to move, the challenge did ask for Someone trying to move an immovable object.Ignirng that, it seems to me that the photo is on an angle.  ie it tilts to the right.  it seems that the camera was not level when taken, and gives an effect of everything sliding to the right', '2008-09-15 03:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
