(4955686, 719139, 96881, '<td valign="top">I will take Woody as being someone (whereas others won''t).<br/>Different idea.<br/>However, it looks to me that none of the photo is in focus.  The crop is slightly off-centre which I dopn''t think works, and I would have not cropped that close to the world at the top</td>', 'I will take Woody as being someone (whereas others won''t).Different idea.However, it looks to me that none of the photo is in focus.  The crop is slightly off-centre which I dopn''t think works, and I would have not cropped that close to the world at the top', '2008-09-15 04:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955687, 719062, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different, but the only part of the photo that appears in focus is the upper arm.  Would have liked a greater depth of field, as I feel focus should have been kepts for a much larger distance, which would have really made this photo work.</td>', 'Different, but the only part of the photo that appears in focus is the upper arm.  Would have liked a greater depth of field, as I feel focus should have been kepts for a much larger distance, which would have really made this photo work.', '2008-09-15 04:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
