(4955691, 720045, 96881, '<td valign="top">yep, can understand that.  The colours are great, lighting works, not sure about the crop on the left though, for some reason it doesn''t work for me.  Not sure if I would prefer to see more or less of this person (probably more).  The leg on the bed might be the distracting thing.....</td>', 'yep, can understand that.  The colours are great, lighting works, not sure about the crop on the left though, for some reason it doesn''t work for me.  Not sure if I would prefer to see more or less of this person (probably more).  The leg on the bed might be the distracting thing.....', '2008-09-15 04:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955692, 720263, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great different take on the topic, while still meeting the challenge.  I would have been tempted to reduce the depth of field, making the line of police sharp, the background less focussed, and the foreground less focussed.  I think this would have added to it, removed clutter from the background, and given more of a sense of movement and people numbers to the crowd at the front, and more of a sense of being in the crowd for the viewer.</td>', 'Great different take on the topic, while still meeting the challenge.  I would have been tempted to reduce the depth of field, making the line of police sharp, the background less focussed, and the foreground less focussed.  I think this would have added to it, removed clutter from the background, and given more of a sense of movement and people numbers to the crowd at the front, and more of a sense of being in the crowd for the viewer.', '2008-09-15 04:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955693, 718491, 96881, '<td valign="top">A different take, and one that works.  I like the idea, the lighting effect and what you have come up with.  The childs arm fades off nicely.  I would have been tempted to do the same with the fathers, leaving slightly more of the photo in on the bottom left where the arm is going out of focus for the same effect</td>', 'A different take, and one that works.  I like the idea, the lighting effect and what you have come up with.  The childs arm fades off nicely.  I would have been tempted to do the same with the fathers, leaving slightly more of the photo in on the bottom left where the arm is going out of focus for the same effect', '2008-09-15 04:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955695, 720089, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am not sure the background, being a very similar shade to his skin when the effect has been applied works here.  They seem to merge together to me, instead of him standing out</td>', 'I am not sure the background, being a very similar shade to his skin when the effect has been applied works here.  They seem to merge together to me, instead of him standing out', '2008-09-15 04:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
