(4956345, 720208, 88501, '<td valign="top">looks like a funny chain email pic but I like the way it fits the challenge idea</td>', 'looks like a funny chain email pic but I like the way it fits the challenge idea', '2008-09-15 14:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956347, 719139, 88501, '<td valign="top">cool idea and nice set up but I think it is a little out of focus</td>', 'cool idea and nice set up but I think it is a little out of focus', '2008-09-15 14:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956348, 720089, 88501, '<td valign="top">that guy''s face is great... pretty funny and lots of character</td>', 'that guy''s face is great... pretty funny and lots of character', '2008-09-15 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956523, 719047, 87898, '<td valign="top">I love the light that comes through the branches and onto the tree itself. I think you should have had the feet in the photo though.</td>', 'I love the light that comes through the branches and onto the tree itself. I think you should have had the feet in the photo though.', '2008-09-15 15:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956527, 720255, 87898, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white. and I love the concept of pairing up ''immovable'' with time as well as the literal representation we see!</td>', 'Nice use of black and white. and I love the concept of pairing up ''immovable'' with time as well as the literal representation we see!', '2008-09-15 15:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956528, 718556, 87898, '<td valign="top">Haha! Very funny. :).</td>', 'Haha! Very funny. :).', '2008-09-15 15:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956533, 718436, 87898, '<td valign="top">Seems a little out of focus. Great expression on the guy w/ the mohawk though!</td>', 'Seems a little out of focus. Great expression on the guy w/ the mohawk though!', '2008-09-15 15:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956538, 720188, 87898, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the diagonal of the rock continues with the diagonal of the person pushing it. Don''t know if this is on purpose or not, but it looks good! :).</td>', 'Nice composition, the diagonal of the rock continues with the diagonal of the person pushing it. Don''t know if this is on purpose or not, but it looks good! :).', '2008-09-15 15:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956540, 719142, 87898, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of field works nicely here :).</td>', 'The shallow depth of field works nicely here :).', '2008-09-15 15:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956546, 720141, 87898, '<td valign="top">Haha, I like this one. Seems a bit flat though - upping the brightness and contrast may help.</td>', 'Haha, I like this one. Seems a bit flat though - upping the brightness and contrast may help.', '2008-09-15 15:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956549, 717912, 87898, '<td valign="top">Wow I love the curves you''ve captured in the leg (the arch of her foot etc)! Sepia works well for this one.</td>', 'Wow I love the curves you''ve captured in the leg (the arch of her foot etc)! Sepia works well for this one.', '2008-09-15 15:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956552, 718456, 87898, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, the sky is beautiful!</td>', 'Oh wow, the sky is beautiful!', '2008-09-15 15:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4956555, 719952, 87898, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to be focused very well.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to be focused very well.', '2008-09-15 15:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957109, 719145, 9510, '<td valign="top">very creative..a bit oversaturated though</td>', 'very creative..a bit oversaturated though', '2008-09-15 20:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957153, 719842, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the title for this.  I find the light a little harsh on his shorts, making them overexposed, also his shins.  Adjusting the levels to reduce this would have helped.  The cap means that his face is in shaddow, so either fill-in flash, or remove the cap would have been better as then it would have brought out the expression more ion his face.<br/>The off-centre crop seems to work.  I would have been tempted to remove some of the foreground, as the  bottom layer of rocks doesn''t add to the effect, and are not sharp either.</td>', 'I like the title for this.  I find the light a little harsh on his shorts, making them overexposed, also his shins.  Adjusting the levels to reduce this would have helped.  The cap means that his face is in shaddow, so either fill-in flash, or remove the cap would have been better as then it would have brought out the expression more ion his face.The off-centre crop seems to work.  I would have been tempted to remove some of the foreground, as the  bottom layer of rocks doesn''t add to the effect, and are not sharp either.', '2008-09-15 20:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957161, 720125, 96881, '<td valign="top">Yes, the item looks immovable, but the description for the chaallenge did say someone trying to move something immovable.  It would have been great if the challenge was left further open (ie just Immovable) as this them would have scored better.  Even a person sitting in the drivers seat, or leaning out the window would then have meant it met the challange completely.<br/>Some light on the bus would have been better, as I find it too dull.  The use of flash or lighting in some way to highlight the bus slightly would have added to this shot.<br/>I am not sure about the crop.  You have cut off the front and rear door slightly.  Some more space both left and right would have added to the balance of the shot and even a little more foreground(with weeds included) could have helped, especially with the extra light.</td>', 'Yes, the item looks immovable, but the description for the chaallenge did say someone trying to move something immovable.  It would have been great if the challenge was left further open (ie just Immovable) as this them would have scored better.  Even a person sitting in the drivers seat, or leaning out the window would then have meant it met the challange completely.Some light on the bus would have been better, as I find it too dull.  The use of flash or lighting in some way to highlight the bus slightly would have added to this shot.I am not sure about the crop.  You have cut off the front and rear door slightly.  Some more space both left and right would have added to the balance of the shot and even a little more foreground(with weeds included) could have helped, especially with the extra light.', '2008-09-15 20:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957164, 719922, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though the man looks blurred, like he is moviong, instead of being still, empahsising no movement.  Would have preferred a slight levels adjustment as his back and left foot look overexposed and washed out.  This would then have emphasised the muscle tone showing his is straining.  Would have been tempted to have him in shots also so that the leg muscle definition could have been shown.</td>', 'Nice idea, though the man looks blurred, like he is moviong, instead of being still, empahsising no movement.  Would have preferred a slight levels adjustment as his back and left foot look overexposed and washed out.  This would then have emphasised the muscle tone showing his is straining.  Would have been tempted to have him in shots also so that the leg muscle definition could have been shown.', '2008-09-15 20:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957266, 720069, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I like the brown colouring.  However, the person seems to blend into the background a bit too much.  OWuld have liked them to be a little more prominent, maybe by being slightly brighter, and a little more contrast in the overall scene.  Many of the crosses and details in the dirt blend in a little too much, and that reduces the effect</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I like the brown colouring.  However, the person seems to blend into the background a bit too much.  OWuld have liked them to be a little more prominent, maybe by being slightly brighter, and a little more contrast in the overall scene.  Many of the crosses and details in the dirt blend in a little too much, and that reduces the effect', '2008-09-15 22:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957269, 718890, 96881, '<td valign="top">Yep, like this one, and the way it meets the challenge.<br/>I would have been tempted to include a little more sky in this.  I feel the crop is a little too close to the top of the rock.  More sky would give more balance.</td>', 'Yep, like this one, and the way it meets the challenge.I would have been tempted to include a little more sky in this.  I feel the crop is a little too close to the top of the rock.  More sky would give more balance.', '2008-09-15 22:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957271, 719636, 96881, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t seem to work for me.  It meets the challenge, but the lighting fopr me does not help.  It casts shaddows which I find distracting.  The hair over much of the face also is a bit distracting for me.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t seem to work for me.  It meets the challenge, but the lighting fopr me does not help.  It casts shaddows which I find distracting.  The hair over much of the face also is a bit distracting for me.', '2008-09-15 22:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957273, 719142, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure i see the person trying to move something immovable here.  The cropping off the end of the tail is a shame.  However the light is good and the photo is sharp</td>', 'Not sure i see the person trying to move something immovable here.  The cropping off the end of the tail is a shame.  However the light is good and the photo is sharp', '2008-09-15 22:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957274, 720188, 96881, '<td valign="top">Composition is good.  I would have reduced the depth of field so that the dense bush behind was more out of facus, thus forming a very interesting backdrop and being less recognisable.  The light on the rock is a problem as the boy is in shaddow.  SOme extra light on him by some means would have then emphasised him more than the rock.  The bright patches ont he rock currently draw attention.</td>', 'Composition is good.  I would have reduced the depth of field so that the dense bush behind was more out of facus, thus forming a very interesting backdrop and being less recognisable.  The light on the rock is a problem as the boy is in shaddow.  SOme extra light on him by some means would have then emphasised him more than the rock.  The bright patches ont he rock currently draw attention.', '2008-09-15 22:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957279, 719650, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different which is often good.  Close enough to meeting the challenge for me.  Unfortunately the light on her face is a little too much, which means some of her expression has been lost.  Apart from that, well composed and well shot.</td>', 'Different which is often good.  Close enough to meeting the challenge for me.  Unfortunately the light on her face is a little too much, which means some of her expression has been lost.  Apart from that, well composed and well shot.', '2008-09-15 22:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957284, 720053, 96881, '<td valign="top">It is a shame that the top of the fingers has been cropped off.  The noise through the background unfortuntely annoys me here as well.  I like the idea both with the shot and the post processing though...</td>', 'It is a shame that the top of the fingers has been cropped off.  The noise through the background unfortuntely annoys me here as well.  I like the idea both with the shot and the post processing though...', '2008-09-15 22:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957292, 720161, 96881, '<td valign="top">The tilt of this photo is distracting.  It would have been better if the weights were straight, such that the bar is straigh across the photo.  Would have also preferred a better stance.  The knees are uneven, and his feet too close.  It doesn''t look like he is really trying to lift this.<br/>I probably would have overemphaised it, and had larger weights (if possible) on the bar as well.</td>', 'The tilt of this photo is distracting.  It would have been better if the weights were straight, such that the bar is straigh across the photo.  Would have also preferred a better stance.  The knees are uneven, and his feet too close.  It doesn''t look like he is really trying to lift this.I probably would have overemphaised it, and had larger weights (if possible) on the bar as well.', '2008-09-15 22:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957293, 720260, 96881, '<td valign="top">I hate brussels sprouts so i will give you the immovable here.  The Sprout is very sharp.  I am not sure about the hand being out of focus.  I would have probably tyied to have the sprout, fork and hand all in focus for this.  Also not sure about the border on this.</td>', 'I hate brussels sprouts so i will give you the immovable here.  The Sprout is very sharp.  I am not sure about the hand being out of focus.  I would have probably tyied to have the sprout, fork and hand all in focus for this.  Also not sure about the border on this.', '2008-09-15 22:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957313, 720045, 96664, '<td valign="top">Good concept!!! I was laughing at this one!!!</td>', 'Good concept!!! I was laughing at this one!!!', '2008-09-15 22:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957317, 719998, 96664, '<td valign="top">Whooh... I like the statue... Very colorful!!!</td>', 'Whooh... I like the statue... Very colorful!!!', '2008-09-15 22:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957318, 720188, 96664, '<td valign="top">O.K. concept but not that original.</td>', 'O.K. concept but not that original.', '2008-09-15 22:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957321, 719952, 96664, '<td valign="top">Like the face of him and the effort it looks like he is putting into it!!!</td>', 'Like the face of him and the effort it looks like he is putting into it!!!', '2008-09-15 22:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957322, 719636, 96664, '<td valign="top">kinda creepy but I like it!!! Haha!</td>', 'kinda creepy but I like it!!! Haha!', '2008-09-15 22:58:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4957324, 720125, 96664, '<td valign="top">Interesting yet a bit to dull on the colors.</td>', 'Interesting yet a bit to dull on the colors.', '2008-09-15 22:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957396, 720148, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gotta give you kudos for a crazy idea.</td>', 'Gotta give you kudos for a crazy idea.', '2008-09-16 00:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957398, 719922, 83313, '<td valign="top">Actually looks like he''s moving it. That would mean it is not immovable at all and hence, a DNMC. (OK, just kidding, I''m actually giving it a 6!)</td>', 'Actually looks like he''s moving it. That would mean it is not immovable at all and hence, a DNMC. (OK, just kidding, I''m actually giving it a 6!)', '2008-09-16 00:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957401, 720293, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this is an immovable object, but I know there is a message to it that you are conveying, which I am not getting.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this is an immovable object, but I know there is a message to it that you are conveying, which I am not getting.', '2008-09-16 00:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957402, 719142, 83313, '<td valign="top">Glad I''m not a fish today.</td>', 'Glad I''m not a fish today.', '2008-09-16 00:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957408, 718556, 83313, '<td valign="top">You are a genius!!! What a great idea! The photo is really just okay, but I have to give you a good score for surprising me with this idea. (Now if someone else has also thought of this, I will brand them as a copycat, since I saw yours first.)</td>', 'You are a genius!!! What a great idea! The photo is really just okay, but I have to give you a good score for surprising me with this idea. (Now if someone else has also thought of this, I will brand them as a copycat, since I saw yours first.)', '2008-09-16 00:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957410, 719952, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ummm,... "NOT" is my guess. He should try moving a rubbertree plant. As far as the shot itself goes, I''m afraid this just comes off as an average snapshot.</td>', 'Ummm,... "NOT" is my guess. He should try moving a rubbertree plant. As far as the shot itself goes, I''m afraid this just comes off as an average snapshot.', '2008-09-16 00:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957414, 720029, 83313, '<td valign="top">This would have been better, except for an excessive amount of JPEG artifacts showing. Your file size of 43k is really small. There are lots of compression artifacts showing and an overall lack of detail. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'This would have been better, except for an excessive amount of JPEG artifacts showing. Your file size of 43k is really small. There are lots of compression artifacts showing and an overall lack of detail. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2008-09-16 00:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957415, 720129, 83313, '<td valign="top">They usually do roll, but this trick is part of the fraternity initiation ritual.</td>', 'They usually do roll, but this trick is part of the fraternity initiation ritual.', '2008-09-16 00:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957416, 720189, 83313, '<td valign="top">Funny! Mean Dad.</td>', 'Funny! Mean Dad.', '2008-09-16 00:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957419, 720053, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one made me stop to try and determine what the message is. I''m not really sure what''s going on here, but I like it.</td>', 'This one made me stop to try and determine what the message is. I''m not really sure what''s going on here, but I like it.', '2008-09-16 00:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957420, 720125, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yup. Immovable. I''m afraid the pic itself just comes off as a snapshot, though.</td>', 'Yup. Immovable. I''m afraid the pic itself just comes off as a snapshot, though.', '2008-09-16 00:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957422, 718927, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing of this. Not sure if it was intentional or not. What is immovable about it? I know you saw something here that fits, but It''s gone over my head.</td>', 'Interesting processing of this. Not sure if it was intentional or not. What is immovable about it? I know you saw something here that fits, but It''s gone over my head.', '2008-09-16 00:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957423, 720208, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can rent you one.</td>', 'I can rent you one.', '2008-09-16 00:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957424, 719145, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fun application of a fisheye. Be careful not to let go.</td>', 'Fun application of a fisheye. Be careful not to let go.', '2008-09-16 00:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957429, 720141, 83313, '<td valign="top">Someone had to have the chutzpah to plagiarize Gary Larson in this challenge. I salute you!</td>', 'Someone had to have the chutzpah to plagiarize Gary Larson in this challenge. I salute you!', '2008-09-16 00:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957430, 720064, 83313, '<td valign="top">How shocking!</td>', 'How shocking!', '2008-09-16 00:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957431, 719062, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, though the colors are a bit dull and the near foreground is washed out.</td>', 'Nice concept, though the colors are a bit dull and the near foreground is washed out.', '2008-09-16 00:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957439, 720255, 33769, '<td valign="top">LOVE it - I''m sure you wish there was spot-editing for this challenge just as much as most of us did - ;) 10! -- tho in spot-editing if you make a print out of this- i''d personally dodge and burn that rope a bit under the ''hands''  and perhaps burn a little at the bottom of the clock -but of course that couldn''t be done for the challenge and I know that ;) :-D  BEAUTIFUL shapes (triangles everywhere!)  ;)</td>', 'LOVE it - I''m sure you wish there was spot-editing for this challenge just as much as most of us did - ;) 10! -- tho in spot-editing if you make a print out of this- i''d personally dodge and burn that rope a bit under the ''hands''  and perhaps burn a little at the bottom of the clock -but of course that couldn''t be done for the challenge and I know that ;) :-D  BEAUTIFUL shapes (triangles everywhere!)  ;)', '2008-09-16 00:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957445, 719650, 33769, '<td valign="top">very creative! :-) I like it! :-)</td>', 'very creative! :-) I like it! :-)', '2008-09-16 00:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957446, 720029, 33769, '<td valign="top">really neat effect here - almost looks like it actually -is- closing in ;) high score :-)</td>', 'really neat effect here - almost looks like it actually -is- closing in ;) high score :-)', '2008-09-16 00:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957447, 719845, 33769, '<td valign="top">LOVE this its a 10 for me ;)</td>', 'LOVE this its a 10 for me ;)', '2008-09-16 00:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957449, 718556, 33769, '<td valign="top">flawlessly developed -  10!!! <br/> <br/>not to mention the fact that I bet you''re getting a lot of laughs ;) this is just soo great it could be an ad! :-)</td>', 'flawlessly developed -  10!!!  not to mention the fact that I bet you''re getting a lot of laughs ;) this is just soo great it could be an ad! :-)', '2008-09-16 00:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957450, 719948, 90626, '<td valign="top">I love his facial expression. Looks very "back-breaking".</td>', 'I love his facial expression. Looks very "back-breaking".', '2008-09-16 00:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957451, 720260, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yup, you are right. It''s not going anywhere! Great pic as well, though you need to watch your JPEG compression settings. It appeared a bit grainy to me, and with a file size of 77k, that is part of why. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one) I would have voted a point higher except for that.</td>', 'Yup, you are right. It''s not going anywhere! Great pic as well, though you need to watch your JPEG compression settings. It appeared a bit grainy to me, and with a file size of 77k, that is part of why. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one) I would have voted a point higher except for that.', '2008-09-16 00:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957453, 719948, 83313, '<td valign="top">What''s taking  him so long?</td>', 'What''s taking  him so long?', '2008-09-16 00:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957456, 719139, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid most of the pic seems slightly out of focus.</td>', 'I''m afraid most of the pic seems slightly out of focus.', '2008-09-16 00:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957525, 720029, 96881, '<td valign="top">Like the idea here.  Would have been better if it looked like both were actually trying to push the rock, instead of leaning onto it.<br/>Space would have been quite dark, and hence the bright overexposed background.  Did you use flash on this.  It may have helped light the people, especially the women on the right who is very dark, and then maybe the back wouldn''t be so overdone and distracting.<br/>I would have liked you to include the feet, rather than cropping the photo off at ankle height.</td>', 'Like the idea here.  Would have been better if it looked like both were actually trying to push the rock, instead of leaning onto it.Space would have been quite dark, and hence the bright overexposed background.  Did you use flash on this.  It may have helped light the people, especially the women on the right who is very dark, and then maybe the back wouldn''t be so overdone and distracting.I would have liked you to include the feet, rather than cropping the photo off at ankle height.', '2008-09-16 02:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957526, 719799, 96881, '<td valign="top">Works well for hte immovable challenge.<br/>Backgroung car/Caravan and pole are istracting.  Maybe a slightly different angle to at least remove the other car out of the photo would have helped.  Taken a little more side on.  Can''t do much about the pole (unless you move the immovable car of course).<br/>Light is good, playing with the depth of field, keeping the women and car in focus and the caravan/trees/fence more blurred could also have worked remove the clutter......</td>', 'Works well for hte immovable challenge.Backgroung car/Caravan and pole are istracting.  Maybe a slightly different angle to at least remove the other car out of the photo would have helped.  Taken a little more side on.  Can''t do much about the pole (unless you move the immovable car of course).Light is good, playing with the depth of field, keeping the women and car in focus and the caravan/trees/fence more blurred could also have worked remove the clutter......', '2008-09-16 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957528, 718882, 96881, '<td valign="top">Yeah, after you finish no-one is moving these.  Like the shot, but not the crop.  Would have preferred all both cars be in the photo, rather than cropping the boot out and the bonnet out of the different cars.  I like the black and white (would also like to see what it looked like in colour).  Would also have been better with a shallower depth of field, so that the crowd faded more into the background.</td>', 'Yeah, after you finish no-one is moving these.  Like the shot, but not the crop.  Would have preferred all both cars be in the photo, rather than cropping the boot out and the bonnet out of the different cars.  I like the black and white (would also like to see what it looked like in colour).  Would also have been better with a shallower depth of field, so that the crowd faded more into the background.', '2008-09-16 02:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957529, 718436, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very different take on the challenge.  None of the photo to me looks in focus.  Both the Guy and the Statue should be sharp and to me they are not here.</td>', 'Very different take on the challenge.  None of the photo to me looks in focus.  Both the Guy and the Statue should be sharp and to me they are not here.', '2008-09-16 02:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957531, 720120, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am not sure about the angle here, its making me want to tilt my head to look at this.  Apart from that, light is good, I like it in black and white.</td>', 'I am not sure about the angle here, its making me want to tilt my head to look at this.  Apart from that, light is good, I like it in black and white.', '2008-09-16 02:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957533, 719845, 96881, '<td valign="top">Stunning Colours in this, and very different take ont he challenge, but definently works.  Love the effect.  Only down side is the colour on the lower part of the hand.  Can''t really do anything about that in Basic Rules so can''t do much about that anyway.  One of the best in my opinion</td>', 'Stunning Colours in this, and very different take ont he challenge, but definently works.  Love the effect.  Only down side is the colour on the lower part of the hand.  Can''t really do anything about that in Basic Rules so can''t do much about that anyway.  One of the best in my opinion', '2008-09-16 02:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4957544, 719650, 87898, '<td valign="top">Great vantage point!</td>', 'Great vantage point!', '2008-09-16 02:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
