(4959052, 719145, 97270, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Prash:</b></div><hr/><i> This is in top 3 for me. Great angle, great depiction, great composition, great color fidelity. Nothing to complain about here. I give it a 10. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am glad you made it to top 3. You had the highest score from me:-)</td>', 'Originally posted by Prash: This is in top 3 for me. Great angle, great depiction, great composition, great color fidelity. Nothing to complain about here. I give it a 10.   I am glad you made it to top 3. You had the highest score from me:-)', '2008-09-17 01:34:59.000000', NULL, 0),
