(5052920, 720293, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey lisa . i''ve called in for a visit &amp; have been looking at some of your last challenge entries .. felt i needed to comment on at least one .. this is it .. and wot an amazing photograph it is .. the look of concentration on your son''s face, the way you''ve cropped it, the butterfly perched on his finger and your brilliant processing .. most definitely a WOW to me  .. :)<br/>ps.. i find it very very annoying when voters make erroneous assumptions and then mark you down .. often with a tiny bit more knowledge a vote of 5 could end up being a 7, 8, 9 or 10 .. oh well .. at least their vote wont kill us .. lol .. !!..:)</td>', 'hey lisa . i''ve called in for a visit & have been looking at some of your last challenge entries .. felt i needed to comment on at least one .. this is it .. and wot an amazing photograph it is .. the look of concentration on your son''s face, the way you''ve cropped it, the butterfly perched on his finger and your brilliant processing .. most definitely a WOW to me  .. :)ps.. i find it very very annoying when voters make erroneous assumptions and then mark you down .. often with a tiny bit more knowledge a vote of 5 could end up being a 7, 8, 9 or 10 .. oh well .. at least their vote wont kill us .. lol .. !!..:)', '2008-11-08 19:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
